## Key Patterns for Distributed Inference

### Pattern 1: Bidi Streaming Worker

```rust
// Each Expert node: one bidi stream per Global node
async fn handle_expert_stream(
    mut stream: Streaming<ExpertRequest>,
    tx: mpsc::Sender<ExpertResponse>,
) {
    while let Some(req) = stream.next().await {
        let req = req?;
        let output = compute_expert_ffn(&req.hidden_states, req.expert_id);
        tx.send(ExpertResponse { output }).await?;
    }
}
```

### Pattern 2: Shared Global State

